---
import landing from '../data/landing.json';
import { BASE } from '../../site.config.mjs';
---

<section class="lp-section" id="compare">
  <div class="lp-wrap">
    <h2>How it relates to other tools</h2>
    <p class="lp-lead">
      Recording a command with its hashes is not new. These notes keep the wording of the project's own comparison,
      including where an existing tool already does the job.
    </p>
    <div class="lp-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table">
        <caption>Related tools, from the README (links go to the tools' own documentation).</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tool</th><th scope="col">Relation to SciProof</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            landing.related.map((row) => (
              <tr>
                <th scope="row" set:html={row.tool} />
                <td set:html={row.relation} />
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-note">
      The full analysis, including what could not be confirmed, is in the
      <a href={`${BASE}/docs/comparison/`}>comparison page</a>. Its differentiation claim is described there as an unproven hypothesis.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
